ce-file="box.tsx"><p>Terriers were a preferred breed during WWI for their loyalty, rodent-hunting skills and friendly demeanors. A New Zealand soldier poses here with a regimental mascot during the Gallipoli campaign in Turkey.</p></div></div><span class="_198y7iph _198y7ipb _198y7ip4 _1qtr0uz3 g1fwxfil g1fwxfju g1fwxfzy" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx" data-sentry-component="Box">Hulton Archive/Getty Images</span></div></div><div class="_1qtr0uz0 g1fwxf7o" data-previous-card="false" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-component="Box" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx"><div class="_1qtr0uz1"><div class="_1qtr0uz4" data-active="false"></div><img alt="" dpr="auto" data-sentry-element="DefaultCldImage" data-sentry-component="CldImage" data-sentry-source-file="cld-image.tsx" loading="lazy" width="550" height="350" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 834px) 100vw,
				(max-width: 1280px) 75vw,
				50vw" srcSet="https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_384,h_244,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/war-gear?_a=BAVAZGID0 384w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_640,h_407,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/war-gear?_a=BAVAZGID0 640w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_750,h_477,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/war-gear?_a=BAVAZGID0 750w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_828,h_526,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/war-gear?_a=BAVAZGID0 828w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_1080,h_687,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/war-gear?_a=BAVAZGID0 1080w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_1200,h_763,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/war-gear?_a=BAVAZGID0 1200w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_1920,h_1221,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/war-gear?_a=BAVAZGID0 1920w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_2048,h_1303,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/war-gear?_a=BAVAZGID0 2048w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_3840,h_2443,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/war-gear?_a=BAVAZGID0 3840w" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_3840,h_2443,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/war-gear?_a=BAVAZGID0"/></div><div class="_1qtr0uz2" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx" data-sentry-component="Box"><div class="_153e98si _153e98sc" data-sentry-component="MaxLines" data-sentry-source-file="max-lines.tsx"><div class="_42elsxd g1fwxfzw" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-component="Box" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx"><p>Germany officially began using dogs during wartime in the late 19th century. In WWI, Allied Forces used at least 20,000 dogs on the battlefield, while the Central Powers—primarily Germany—used about 30,000.</p></div></div><span class="_198y7iph _198y7ipb _198y7ip4 _1qtr0uz3 g1fwxfil g1fwxfju g1fwxfzy" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx" data-sentry-component="Box">Henry Guttmann/Getty Images</span></div></div><div class="_1qtr0uz0 g1fwxf7o" data-previous-card="false" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-component="Box" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx"><div class="_1qtr0uz1"><div class="_1qtr0uz4" data-active="false"></div><img alt="" dpr="auto" data-sentry-element="DefaultCldImage" data-sentry-component="CldImage" data-sentry-source-file="cld-image.tsx" loading="lazy" width="550" height="350" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 834px) 100vw,
				(max-width: 1280px) 75vw,
				50vw" srcSet="https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_384,h_244,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/speedy-delivery?_a=BAVAZGID0 384w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_640,h_407,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/speedy-delivery?_a=BAVAZGID0 640w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_750,h_477,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/speedy-delivery?_a=BAVAZGID0 750w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_828,h_526,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/speedy-delivery?_a=BAVAZGID0 828w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_1080,h_687,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/speedy-delivery?_a=BAVAZGID0 1080w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_1200,h_763,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/speedy-delivery?_a=BAVAZGID0 1200w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_1920,h_1221,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/speedy-delivery?_a=BAVAZGID0 1920w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_2048,h_1303,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/speedy-delivery?_a=BAVAZGID0 2048w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_3840,h_2443,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/speedy-delivery?_a=BAVAZGID0 3840w" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_3840,h_2443,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/speedy-delivery?_a=BAVAZGID0"/></div><div class="_1qtr0uz2" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx" data-sentry-component="Box"><div class="_153e98si _153e98sc" data-sentry-component="MaxLines" data-sentry-source-file="max-lines.tsx"><div class="_42elsxd g1fwxfzw" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-component="Box" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx"><p>During World War I, dogs were primarily used as messengers. On July 5, 1916, this messenger dog used by the British Army in Flanders, Belgium, runs to the front with urgent messages.</p></div></div><span class="_198y7iph _198y7ipb _198y7ip4 _1qtr0uz3 g1fwxfil g1fwxfju g1fwxfzy" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx" data-sentry-component="Box">Daily Mirror/Mirrorpix/Getty Images</span></div></div><div class="_1qtr0uz0 g1fwxf7o" data-previous-card="false" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-component="Box" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx"><div class="_1qtr0uz1"><div class="_1qtr0uz4" data-active="false"></div><img alt="" dpr="auto" data-sentry-element="DefaultCldImage" data-sentry-component="CldImage" data-sentry-source-file="cld-image.tsx" loading="lazy" width="550" height="350" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 834px) 100vw,
				(max-width: 1280px) 75vw,
				50vw" srcSet="https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_384,h_244,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/special-collars?_a=BAVAZGID0 384w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_640,h_407,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/special-collars?_a=BAVAZGID0 640w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_750,h_477,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/special-collars?_a=BAVAZGID0 750w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_828,h_526,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/special-collars?_a=BAVAZGID0 828w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_1080,h_687,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/special-collars?_a=BAVAZGID0 1080w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_1200,h_763,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/special-collars?_a=BAVAZGID0 1200w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_1920,h_1221,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/special-collars?_a=BAVAZGID0 1920w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_2048,h_1303,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/special-collars?_a=BAVAZGID0 2048w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_3840,h_2443,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/special-collars?_a=BAVAZGID0 3840w" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_3840,h_2443,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/special-collars?_a=BAVAZGID0"/></div><div class="_1qtr0uz2" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx" data-sentry-component="Box"><div class="_153e98si _153e98sc" data-sentry-component="MaxLines" data-sentry-source-file="max-lines.tsx"><div class="_42elsxd g1fwxfzw" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-component="Box" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx"><p>Message dogs were often outfitted with collars that had attached cylinders. Here, a sergeant of the Royal Engineers places a message into the cylinder on August 28, 1918, at Etaples, France.</p></div></div><span class="_198y7iph _198y7ipb _198y7ip4 _1qtr0uz3 g1fwxfil g1fwxfju g1fwxfzy" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx" data-sentry-component="Box">Second Lt. D McLellan/IWM/Getty Images</span></div></div><div class="_1qtr0uz0 g1fwxf7o" data-previous-card="false" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-component="Box" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx"><div class="_1qtr0uz1"><div class="_1qtr0uz4" data-active="false"></div><img alt="" dpr="auto" data-sentry-element="DefaultCldImage" data-sentry-component="CldImage" data-sentry-source-file="cld-image.tsx" loading="lazy" width="550" height="350" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 834px) 100vw,
				(max-width: 1280px) 75vw,
				50vw" srcSet="https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_384,h_244,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/obstacle-course?_a=BAVAZGID0 384w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_640,h_407,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/obstacle-course?_a=BAVAZGID0 640w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_750,h_477,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/obstacle-course?_a=BAVAZGID0 750w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_828,h_526,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/obstacle-course?_a=BAVAZGID0 828w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_1080,h_687,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/obstacle-course?_a=BAVAZGID0 1080w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_1200,h_763,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/obstacle-course?_a=BAVAZGID0 1200w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_1920,h_1221,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/obstacle-course?_a=BAVAZGID0 1920w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_2048,h_1303,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/obstacle-course?_a=BAVAZGID0 2048w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_3840,h_2443,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/obstacle-course?_a=BAVAZGID0 3840w" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_3840,h_2443,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/obstacle-course?_a=BAVAZGID0"/></div><div class="_1qtr0uz2" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx" data-sentry-component="Box"><div class="_153e98si _153e98sc" data-sentry-component="MaxLines" data-sentry-source-file="max-lines.tsx"><div class="_42elsxd g1fwxfzw" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-component="Box" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx"><p>Messenger dogs such as &#x27;Wolf,&#x27; an Alsatian, often had to negotiate dangerous obstacles, including barbed wire entanglements. Here, Wolf clears a fence at the Western Front in Flanders, Belgium.</p></div></div><span class="_198y7iph _198y7ipb _198y7ip4 _1qtr0uz3 g1fwxfil g1fwxfju g1fwxfzy" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx" data-sentry-component="Box">Popperfoto/Getty Images</span></div></div><div class="_1qtr0uz0 g1fwxf7o" data-previous-card="false" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-component="Box" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx"><div class="_1qtr0uz1"><div class="_1qtr0uz4" data-active="false"></div><img alt="" dpr="auto" data-sentry-element="DefaultCldImage" data-sentry-component="CldImage" data-sentry-source-file="cld-image.tsx" loading="lazy" width="550" height="350" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 834px) 100vw,
				(max-width: 1280px) 75vw,
				50vw" srcSet="https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_384,h_244,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/team-work?_a=BAVAZGID0 384w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_640,h_407,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/team-work?_a=BAVAZGID0 640w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_750,h_477,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/team-work?_a=BAVAZGID0 750w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_828,h_526,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/team-work?_a=BAVAZGID0 828w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_1080,h_687,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/team-work?_a=BAVAZGID0 1080w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_1200,h_763,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/team-work?_a=BAVAZGID0 1200w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_1920,h_1221,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/team-work?_a=BAVAZGID0 1920w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_2048,h_1303,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/team-work?_a=BAVAZGID0 2048w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_3840,h_2443,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/team-work?_a=BAVAZGID0 3840w" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_3840,h_2443,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/team-work?_a=BAVAZGID0"/></div><div class="_1qtr0uz2" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx" data-sentry-component="Box"><div class="_153e98si _153e98sc" data-sentry-component="MaxLines" data-sentry-source-file="max-lines.tsx"><div class="_42elsxd g1fwxfzw" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-component="Box" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx"><p>While horses were often used to haul heavy guns and other equipment, teams of dogs would also be recruited for hauling weapons and other objects. Italian soldiers oversee dogs performing such work in 1917.</p></div></div><span class="_198y7iph _198y7ipb _198y7ip4 _1qtr0uz3 g1fwxfil g1fwxfju g1fwxfzy" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx" data-sentry-component="Box">Topical Press Agency/Getty Images</span></div></div><div class="_1qtr0uz0 g1fwxf7o" data-previous-card="false" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-component="Box" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx"><div class="_1qtr0uz1"><div class="_1qtr0uz4" data-active="false"></div><img alt="" dpr="auto" data-sentry-element="DefaultCldImage" data-sentry-component="CldImage" data-sentry-source-file="cld-image.tsx" loading="lazy" width="550" height="350" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 834px) 100vw,
				(max-width: 1280px) 75vw,
				50vw" srcSet="https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_384,h_244,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/in-the-trenches?_a=BAVAZGID0 384w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_640,h_407,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/in-the-trenches?_a=BAVAZGID0 640w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_750,h_477,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/in-the-trenches?_a=BAVAZGID0 750w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_828,h_526,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/in-the-trenches?_a=BAVAZGID0 828w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_1080,h_687,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/in-the-trenches?_a=BAVAZGID0 1080w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_1200,h_763,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/in-the-trenches?_a=BAVAZGID0 1200w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_1920,h_1221,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/in-the-trenches?_a=BAVAZGID0 1920w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_2048,h_1303,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/in-the-trenches?_a=BAVAZGID0 2048w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_3840,h_2443,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/in-the-trenches?_a=BAVAZGID0 3840w" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_3840,h_2443,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/in-the-trenches?_a=BAVAZGID0"/></div><div class="_1qtr0uz2" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx" data-sentry-component="Box"><div class="_153e98si _153e98sc" data-sentry-component="MaxLines" data-sentry-source-file="max-lines.tsx"><div class="_42elsxd g1fwxfzw" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-component="Box" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx"><p>Dogs, with their keen hearing, endured frequent exposure to gunfire and other loud sounds of battle. This dog belonged to a U.K. officer, who brought him to the trenches in 1914.</p></div></div><span class="_198y7iph _198y7ipb _198y7ip4 _1qtr0uz3 g1fwxfil g1fwxfju g1fwxfzy" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx" data-sentry-component="Box">Maurice-Louis Branger/Roger Viollet/Getty Images</span></div></div><div class="_1qtr0uz0 g1fwxf7o" data-previous-card="false" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-component="Box" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx"><div class="_1qtr0uz1"><div class="_1qtr0uz4" data-active="false"></div><img alt="" dpr="auto" data-sentry-element="DefaultCldImage" data-sentry-component="CldImage" data-sentry-source-file="cld-image.tsx" loading="lazy" width="550" height="350" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 834px) 100vw,
				(max-width: 1280px) 75vw,
				50vw" srcSet="https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_384,h_244,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/keen-eyesight?_a=BAVAZGID0 384w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_640,h_407,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/keen-eyesight?_a=BAVAZGID0 640w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_750,h_477,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/keen-eyesight?_a=BAVAZGID0 750w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_828,h_526,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/keen-eyesight?_a=BAVAZGID0 828w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_1080,h_687,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/keen-eyesight?_a=BAVAZGID0 1080w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_1200,h_763,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/keen-eyesight?_a=BAVAZGID0 1200w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_1920,h_1221,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/keen-eyesight?_a=BAVAZGID0 1920w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_2048,h_1303,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/keen-eyesight?_a=BAVAZGID0 2048w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_3840,h_2443,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/keen-eyesight?_a=BAVAZGID0 3840w" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_3840,h_2443,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/keen-eyesight?_a=BAVAZGID0"/></div><div class="_1qtr0uz2" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx" data-sentry-component="Box"><div class="_153e98si _153e98sc" data-sentry-component="MaxLines" data-sentry-source-file="max-lines.tsx"><div class="_42elsxd g1fwxfzw" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-component="Box" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx"><p>Visual cues were critical for dogs on missions during World War I. German soldiers in 1916 appear to point something important out to a dog serving as a messenger in the field.</p></div></div><span class="_198y7iph _198y7ipb _198y7ip4 _1qtr0uz3 g1fwxfil g1fwxfju g1fwxfzy" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx" data-sentry-component="Box">Popperfoto/Getty Images</span></div></div><div class="_1qtr0uz0 g1fwxf7o" data-previous-card="false" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-component="Box" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx"><div class="_1qtr0uz1"><div class="_1qtr0uz4" data-active="false"></div><img alt="" dpr="auto" data-sentry-element="DefaultCldImage" data-sentry-component="CldImage" data-sentry-source-file="cld-image.tsx" loading="lazy" width="550" height="350" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 834px) 100vw,
				(max-width: 1280px) 75vw,
				50vw" srcSet="https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_384,h_244,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/skilled-rat-hunters?_a=BAVAZGID0 384w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_640,h_407,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/skilled-rat-hunters?_a=BAVAZGID0 640w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_750,h_477,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/skilled-rat-hunters?_a=BAVAZGID0 750w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_828,h_526,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/skilled-rat-hunters?_a=BAVAZGID0 828w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_1080,h_687,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/skilled-rat-hunters?_a=BAVAZGID0 1080w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_1200,h_763,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/skilled-rat-hunters?_a=BAVAZGID0 1200w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_1920,h_1221,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/skilled-rat-hunters?_a=BAVAZGID0 1920w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_2048,h_1303,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/skilled-rat-hunters?_a=BAVAZGID0 2048w, https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_3840,h_2443,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/skilled-rat-hunters?_a=BAVAZGID0 3840w" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/aenetworks/image/upload/c_fill,w_3840,h_2443,g_auto/dpr_auto/f_auto/q_auto:eco/v1/skilled-rat-hunters?_a=BAVAZGID0"/></div><div class="_1qtr0uz2" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx" data-sentry-component="Box"><div class="_153e98si _153e98sc" data-sentry-component="MaxLines" data-sentry-source-file="max-lines.tsx"><div class="_42elsxd g1fwxfzw" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-component="Box" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx"><p>WWI dogs, especially terriers, proved to be productive rat hunters—an invaluable skill in the war’s rodent-infested trenches. Here, a terrier poses with some of his kill near the front lines of France, May 1916.</p></div></div><span class="_198y7iph _198y7ipb _198y7ip4 _1qtr0uz3 g1fwxfil g1fwxfju g1fwxfzy" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx" data-sentry-component="Box">Adoc-Photos/Corbis/Getty Images</span></div></div><div class="_1qtr0uz0 g1fwxf7o" data-previous-card="false" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-component="Box" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx"><div class="_1qtr0uz1"><div class="_1qtr0uz4" data-active="false"></div><img alt="" dpr="auto" data-sentry-element="DefaultCldImage" data-sentry-component="CldImage" data-sentry-source-file="cld-image.tsx" loading="lazy" width="550" height="350" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 834px) 100vw,
				(max-width: 1280px) 75vw,
