ogs (who they named Crown Prince and Kaiser Bill) before returning with them to the U.S.</p></div></div><span class="_198y7iph _198y7ipb _198y7ip4 _1qtr0uz3 g1fwxfil g1fwxfju g1fwxfzy" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx" data-sentry-component="Box">War Department/Buyenlarge/Getty Images</span></div></div></div></div><button class="_17na1ev0 _1jnz0oc1y _1qmmerr3 _1qmmerr2" type="button" aria-label="previous slide" aria-hidden="true" data-sentry-element="IconButton" data-sentry-source-file="photo-carousel.tsx"><svg width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" class="g1fwxfzw _11axmyd9 _11axmyd5" data-sentry-element="svg" data-sentry-component="IconSvg" data-sentry-source-file="icon.tsx"><path d="M30 36L18 24L30 12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="inherit" stroke-linejoin="inherit" data-sentry-element="path" data-sentry-source-file="chevron-left.tsx"></path></svg></button><button class="_17na1ev0 _1jnz0oc1y _1qmmerr4 _1qmmerr2" type="button" aria-label="next slide" aria-hidden="true" data-sentry-element="IconButton" data-sentry-source-file="photo-carousel.tsx"><svg width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" class="g1fwxf103 _11axmyd9 _11axmyd7" data-sentry-element="svg" data-sentry-component="IconSvg" data-sentry-source-file="icon.tsx"><path d="M18 36L30 24L18 12" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="inherit" stroke-linejoin="inherit" data-sentry-element="path" data-sentry-source-file="chevron-right.tsx"></path></svg></button></div></div></div><div class="x4or4w6 i94vss2 i94vss5 g1fwxf4f g1fwxf6o g1fwxfzp" data-name="bleed section" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-component="Box" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx"><div class="i94vss4 g1fwxf4l g1fwxf6f g1fwxfnf g1fwxflo g1fwxfzp g1fwxfii" data-name="section" style="overflow-x:hidden" data-sentry-element="Componen