entry-element="Component" data-sentry-component="Box" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx"><p>Contrasting patterns helped throw off Germans’ calculations when aiming a torpedo. Shown: USS Minneapolis painted in dazzle camouflage, 1917.</p></div></div><span class="_198y7iph _198y7ipb _198y7ip4 _1qtr0uz3 g1fwxfil g1fwxfju g1fwxfzy" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx" data-sentry-component="Box">GHI/Universal History Archive via Getty Images</span></div></div><div class="_1qtr0uz0 g1fwxf7o" data-previous-card="false" data-sentry-element="Component" data-sentry-component="Box" data-sentry-source-file="box.tsx"><div class="_1qtr0uz1"><div class="_1qtr0uz4" data-active="false"></div><img alt="" dpr="auto" data-sentry-element="DefaultCldImage" data-sentry-component="CldImage" data-sentry-source-file="cld-image.tsx" loading="lazy" width="550" height="350" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="" style="color:transparent" sizes="(max-width: 834px) 100vw,
